Population decision: randomized two-sequence, two-period pharmacokinetic study compares test reference formulations eligible healthy adults, receiving formulations assigned order. Procedures endpoint: Evaluate single specified log-transformed PK parameter, AUC, using fixed sampling, washout, assay, evaluable-profile rules. Planning inputs: Assume within-subject cv = 0.25, expected geometric mean ratio theta0 = 1.0, bounds 0.80–1.25, one-sided α=0.05, 80% power. Source CV compatible crossover data PK parameter. design: function evaluates log-scale TOST power searches sequence size. AUC, Cmax, co-primary PK endpoints must pass, assess requirement choose study size covers prespecified objectives. Formula (exact noncentral \(t\), Phillips 1990): \[	ext{Power} = F_t(-t_{1-\alpha, 
u}; 
u, \delta_2) - F_t(t_{1-\alpha, 
u}; 
u, \delta_1), \quad 
u = N-2\] Result recruitment: 12 per sequence, 24 complete subjects, calculated power 83.72%. 10% incomplete profiles, plan 28 recruits across balanced sequences. Recalculate expected ratio departs 1.0.

研究背景与人群：拟在符合方案要求的健康成人中，进行受试制剂与参比制剂的随机、两序列、两周期交叉药代研究，每人按顺序接受两种制剂。 实施与主要结局：以单个已指定的药代参数（例如 AUC）的对数值进行等效性评价，预先固定采血计划、洗脱期、分析方法及有效药代曲线判定规则。 参数设定与依据：教学假设个体内 CV=0.25、预期几何均数比 theta0 = 1.0，接受范围为 0.80–1.25，单侧 α=0.05、目标效能 80%。CV 应来自相近制剂和相同药代参数的交叉数据。 设计选择：函数在对数尺度计算 TOST 效能并搜索序列人数。若 Cmax 等多个主要药代参数都需达标，应分别评价所需样本量，并在方案中选择能覆盖全部要求的规模。 数学公式与出处： \[	ext{Power} = F_t(-t_{1-\alpha, 
u}; 
u, \delta_2) - F_t(t_{1-\alpha, 
u}; 
u, \delta_1), \quad 
u = N - 2\] 出处：Phillips, K. F. (1990). J Pharmacokinet Biopharm, 18(2), 137-144; Julious (2004) Eq 13. 输出解读与招募安排：需每序列 12 人、共 24 名完成两周期的受试者，模型计算的效能为 83.72%。预计 10% 不能完成时，可招募 28 人，并保持两序列平衡；偏离 1.0 的预期均数比需重新计算。
